       "label": "Météo-France · códigos y diagnóstico PTYPE de AROME",
       "url": "https://confluence-meteofrance.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/OpenDataMeteoFrance/pages/1674051588/Comprendre+les+diagnostics+de+type+de+pr+cipitation+dans+les+mod+les+AROME+de+M+t+o-France"
